// ===== Syncthing 忽略规则（两机实时同步层）=====
// git 已覆盖版本化文件；这里只排除每台机器各自重建的缓存/产物
// 注意：此文件随 git 走，改这里两台机器都会生效

// ===== 依赖（每台机器各自 npm install 重建）=====
/node_modules
/server/node_modules

// ===== Unity 工程缓存（每台机器各自重导入）=====
unity/Library
unity/Temp
unity/Obj
unity/Build
unity/Builds
unity/Logs
unity/UserSettings
unity/MemoryCaptures
unity/Recordings
unity/.utmp

// ===== Codely 智能体本地配置 =====
.codely-cli

// ===== 构建产物 =====
**/dist
**/*.br
**/*.gz
**/*.log

// ===== 系统垃圾 =====
**/Thumbs.db
**/desktop.ini
